Site plan. Where construction plans are submitted to the city, a landscaping site plan for the development or the improvement of any nonexempt parcel of land shall be submitted. No building permit shall be issued for projects/lots until the landscaping site plan has been reviewed and approved by the administrator or his or her designated representative. The landscaping site plans shall show the following information:
